 "description": "The FIPS 140-2 Module is a complete encryption system that provides USB 3.1 interface to any SATA media. The boundary includes all CSPs including seed generation, RNG, code storage & all encryption functions. No CSPs leave the boundary for improved security. Its software free design allows interface to any host that supports USB & mass storage. The module supports 1 Admin & 4 users, brute force, recovery PINs, 7-16 digit PINs, auto lock, read only, etc. & is compatible with Apricorn’s Aegis Configurator. The FIPS 140-2 Module is used in Aegis Fortress, Padlock DT FIPS & Padlock SSD.",
